<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#Sx5" title="In LOC: A General Language-Guided Framework for Open-Set 3D Occupancy Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In LOC: A General Language-Guided Framework for Open-Set 3D Occupancy Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#Sx7" title="In LOC: A General Language-Guided Framework for Open-Set 3D Occupancy Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Appendix</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx7.SSx1" title="In Appendix ‣ LOC: A General Language-Guided Framework for Open-Set 3D Occupancy Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Vocabulary</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx7.SSx2" title="In Appendix ‣ LOC: A General Language-Guided Framework for Open-Set 3D Occupancy Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Feature space sparsity</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx7.SSx3" title="In Appendix ‣ LOC: A General Language-Guided Framework for Open-Set 3D Occupancy Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Additional Experiments</span></a>
