<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx7.SSx3.SSS0.Px2" title="In Additional Experiments ‣ Appendix ‣ LOC: A General Language-Guided Framework for Open-Set 3D Occupancy Prediction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Additional Baseline Results</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
