<figure id="Sx4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>3D occupancy prediction performance on the Occ3D-nuScenes occupancy benchmark. We report the mIoU for semantics across different categories, along with per-class semantic IoUs. ”Occ GT” indicates whether occupancy ground-truth supervision is required. The lower half of the table specifically presents results for language-driven methods.</figcaption>
